// One field, and it is not a tuning knob: each pack has exactly one kernel, and its
// block size and its outer, inner and stride extents are all computed from the graph's
// dims and stride order at plan build, so nothing about the launch is keyed here.
// `direction` exists because the two packs share this schema and the catalog keys
// kernels by their completed metadata tuple -- without it the forward and backward
// kernels would present the same empty tuple to one engine's catalog and collide.
